OL,3,AIran war threatens Healey's Budget
OL,4,Aplans, think tank warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe price spike caused by the US-Israel
OL,7,Fwar in Iran poses a major challenge for
OL,8,FChancellor John Healey as he puts
OL,9,Ftogether his first Budget, an
OL,10,Finfluential think tank has warned.
OL,12,FHigher-than-expected inflation could
OL,13,Feat into what the government hoped to
OL,14,Fspend on public services, meaning
OL,15,FHealey will have to choose between
OL,16,Fspending cuts, tax rises, or a mixture
OL,17,Fof both, the Institute for Fiscal
OL,18,FStudies (IFS) said.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
