OL,3,AWildlife park remains closed after
OL,4,Atiger attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FYorkshire Wildlife Park remains closed
OL,7,Fafter a man climbed into a tiger
OL,8,Fenclosure and was fatally attacked by
OL,9,Fthe animal.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,12,Fpark near Doncaster, South Yorkshire,
OL,13,Fat about 13:30 BST on Saturday after
OL,14,Freports of a man climbing down into the
OL,15,Fenclosure from a walkway.
OL,17,FAn eyewitness described seeing the man
OL,18,Fwearing headphones and "pacing around"
OL,19,Fnear the enclosure before he went in
OL,20,Fand was attacked. Police said the man
OL,21,Fsadly died at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
